00:23:09,980 --> 00:23:12,460
It's a wonderful, wonderful thing to watch happen.

333
00:23:12,780 --> 00:23:16,940
You don't necessarily end up with that crisp

334
00:23:17,100 --> 00:23:20,060
military unit that somehow,

335
00:23:21,100 --> 00:23:24,460
somehow is really down at the

336
00:23:24,960 --> 00:23:28,380
core of a lot of our thinking. You don't end up with

