00:23:28,880 --> 00:23:31,740
that wonderful, crisp, managerial,

338
00:23:32,380 --> 00:23:35,660
kind of efficient business style

339
00:23:35,980 --> 00:23:39,420
of things. It's a little more messy around

340
00:23:39,920 --> 00:23:44,140
the edges than that, because we have the incredible gift as Scout leaders

341
00:23:44,640 --> 00:23:48,540
of watching people do this for the very first time in

342
00:23:49,040 --> 00:23:53,340
their lives and begin to form these

343
00:23:53,840 --> 00:23:57,180
parts of their personality. It's a real

